          <h2 id="fleet-training-intro-heading" class="heading-lg">Experienced Support for Your Fleet Department</h2>
          <div class="rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <p class="body-md">When your organization does not have staff in place—or available—to evaluate vehicles and equipment, TRG provides experienced fleet management consulting as an extension of your team. The service supports asset evaluation, replacement planning and budgeting, alongside utilization, equipment specifications and total cost of ownership analysis. The focus is on helping your company plan and operate its fleet department.</p>
        </div>
