<section class="section section--pad" aria-labelledby="fleet-training-support-heading">
  <div class="panel panel--soft">
    <div class="trg-editable" data-trg-editable>
      <div class="trg-editable__fallback">
        <h2 id="fleet-training-support-heading" class="heading-lg">Where TRG Can Support Your Fleet</h2>
        <div class="rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <p class="body-md">Consulting can address the following areas. Discuss your assets and planning needs to define the scope of support.</p>
        <div class="info-grid">
          <article class="info-card">
            <h3 class="heading-sm">Equipment Evaluations</h3>
            <p class="body-sm">Evaluate vehicle and equipment assets to support replacement and budget planning. Share the assets you need reviewed and the decisions your organization is preparing to make.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="info-card">
            <h3 class="heading-sm">Replacement Planning</h3>
            <p class="body-sm">Support planning for vehicle and equipment replacement. Discuss your existing fleet, replacement priorities and planning timeframe.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="info-card">
            <h3 class="heading-sm">Fleet Utilization</h3>
            <p class="body-sm">Consider how vehicles and equipment are used within your fleet. Discuss utilization questions alongside your organization’s operating needs.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="info-card">
            <h3 class="heading-sm">Equipment Specifications</h3>
            <p class="body-sm">Support consideration of vehicle and equipment specifications. Share your equipment needs and the specification questions requiring experienced input.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="info-card">
            <h3 class="heading-sm">Total Cost of Ownership</h3>
            <p class="body-sm">Analyze ownership costs as part of fleet planning. Discuss available cost information and the ownership questions relevant to your equipment decisions.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="info-card">
            <h3 class="heading-sm">Planning &amp; Budgeting</h3>
            <p class="body-sm">Assist with fleet department planning and replacement budgeting. Discuss upcoming decisions and where additional vehicle management support is needed.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="trg-editable__cms">
        <squarespace:block-field id="fleetManagementTrainingSupport" columns="12" label="EDIT: Where TRG Can Support Your Fleet" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

